about: a shared block nested in a removed one goes with its parent even though another owner remains, and nothing is narrowed in a block that went
op: dropBlocks
removed: ["widget"]
=== input
# flama:begin widget
widget:
  # flama:begin widget|gadget
  shared: true
  # flama:end widget|gadget
# flama:end widget
tail
=== output
# flama:begin widget
# flama:end widget
tail
